Package: splcr
Type: Package
Title: Smoothed Predictive Likelihood for Competing Risks
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hao", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "hao.chen@sydney.edu.au"),
    person("Clara", "Grazian", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Likelihood-based validation for competing-risks prediction models
    via post-hoc k-nearest-neighbour kernel smoothing of stepwise baseline
    components from cause-specific Cox and Fine-Gray models. Provides cross-
    validated smoothed predictive log-scores and delete-one-fold jackknife
    standard errors.
